{
  "slug": "bezout-identity-oq-03-oq-01-oq-01-oq-03",
  "title": "k-fold CRT, Pi-type form: ℤ/(∏ nᵢ)ℤ ≅ ∏_{i:Fin k} ℤ/nᵢℤ",
  "phase": "COMPLETED",
